{100}{}{Genvault}
{1000}{}{Thank you for saving us.
---
I was a little unsure that you could do it, but I trust you now.
---
Thank you! Thank you!
---
You are a hero. My little boy wants to be just like you when he grows up. I don't know
if I like that.
---
You are a heroine. My little girl wants to be just like you when she grows up. I don't
know if I like that.
---
You are a swell guy!
---
You are a swell gal!}
